#, javascript-format
msgid "%d min %d s"
msgstr "%d min %d s"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:17 src/lib/ui.js:62
#, javascript-format
msgid "%d min"
msgstr "%d min"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:43
#, javascript-format
msgid "Keep lit · %s"
msgstr "Garder allumé · %s"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:44
msgid "Keep lit until I darken it"
msgstr "Garder allumé jusqu’à ce que je l’assombrisse"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:45
msgid "Darken now"
msgstr "Assombrir maintenant"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:46
msgid "Turn the screen back on"
msgstr "Rallumer l’écran"

#: src/lib/ui.js:36
msgid "Day brightness"
msgstr "Luminosité de jour"

#: src/lib/ui.js:38
msgid "Extra dimming"
msgstr "Atténuation supplémentaire"

#: src/lib/ui.js:39
msgid ""
"Darkens the picture further when the monitor is already at its lowest "
"brightness."
msgstr ""
"Assombrit encore l’image quand l’écran est déjà à sa luminosité la plus "
"basse."

#: src/lib/ui.js:45
msgid "Night light"
msgstr "Éclairage nocturne"

#: src/lib/ui.js:46 src/lib/ui.js:1839
msgid ""
"Blue light in the evening holds back melatonin, the sleep hormone. A warmer "
"screen helps you fall asleep more easily."
msgstr ""
"Le soir, la lumière bleue freine la mélatonine, l’hormone du sommeil. Un "
"écran plus chaud vous aide à vous endormir plus facilement."

#: src/lib/ui.js:47
msgid ""
"How strong Night Light is on this monitor. ×1 = exactly GNOME’s Night Light, "
"nothing added. ×0 turns it off here, ×2 makes it twice as warm."
msgstr ""
"Force de l’éclairage nocturne sur cet écran. ×1 = exactement celui de GNOME, "
"rien en plus. ×0 le coupe ici, ×2 le rend deux fois plus chaud."

#: src/lib/ui.js:48
msgid "Red light"
msgstr "Lumière rouge"

#: src/lib/ui.js:49 src/lib/ui.js:1856
msgid ""
"Red light disturbs melatonin and your body clock the least of all colours. "
"Ideal for the last hours before bed."
msgstr ""
"La lumière rouge est la couleur qui perturbe le moins la mélatonine et "
"l’horloge interne. Idéale pour les dernières heures avant le coucher."

#: src/lib/ui.js:50
msgid ""
"How strong the red screen is on this monitor. ×1 = the red screen as set in "
"the Night Light menu, nothing added. ×0 keeps this monitor normal, ×2 makes "
"it twice as red."
msgstr ""
"Force de l’écran rouge sur cet écran. ×1 = l’écran rouge réglé dans le menu "
"Éclairage nocturne, rien en plus. ×0 le laisse normal, ×2 le rend deux fois "
"plus rouge."

