#, javascript-format
msgid "%d h %d min"
msgstr "%d h %d min"

#: src/lib/ui.js:63
#, javascript-format
msgid "%d h"
msgstr "%d h"

#: src/lib/ui.js:284
msgid "Earlier"
msgstr "Plus tôt"

#: src/lib/ui.js:287
msgid "Later"
msgstr "Plus tard"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1095
msgid "Automatic dimming and more"
msgstr "Assombrissement automatique et plus"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1264
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1308
msgid ""
"Slowly dims this monitor in the evening, and brings it back in the morning."
msgstr "Assombrit lentement cet écran le soir et le rétablit le matin."

#: src/lib/ui.js:1309
msgid ""
"Drag the points to shape the evening; the big point also sets how long it "
"takes. + adds a button that runs by itself."
msgstr ""
"Faites glisser les points pour façonner la soirée ; le gros point fixe aussi "
"sa durée. + ajoute un bouton qui agit tout seul."

#: src/lib/ui.js:1326
msgid "Shorter"
msgstr "Plus court"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1327
msgid "Longer"
msgstr "Plus long"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1337
msgid "Back to normal in the morning"
msgstr "Retour à la normale le matin"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1341
msgid ""
"When the morning comes, lowest light and turned off screens go back to "
"normal, whether they were switched on by hand or by the graph."
msgstr ""
"Le matin, la lumière minimale et les écrans éteints reviennent à la normale, "
"qu’ils aient été activés à la main ou par le graphique."

#: src/lib/ui.js:1374
msgid "Back to 100 %"
msgstr "Revenir à 100 %"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1377 src/lib/ui.js:1379
msgid "Back to the default evening curve"
msgstr "Revenir à la courbe de soirée par défaut"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1395
msgid "Back to the default: ×1 and GNOME’s automatic time (sunset)"
msgstr "Par défaut : ×1 et l’heure automatique de GNOME (coucher du soleil)"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1400
msgid "Back to ×1"
msgstr "Revenir à ×1"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1418
msgid "Day"
msgstr "Jour"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1418
msgid "Night"
msgstr "Nuit"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1418
msgid "Extra"
msgstr "Extra"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1419
msgid "Warmth"
msgstr "Chaleur"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1419
msgid "Red"
msgstr "Rouge"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1451 src/lib/ui.js:1600 src/lib/ui.js:1869
msgid "Back to the default"
msgstr "Revenir à la valeur par défaut"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1556
msgid "While the screen is off"
msgstr "Pendant que l’écran est éteint"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1596
msgid "Dark while off"
msgstr "Noirceur une fois éteint"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1597
msgid ""
"While the screen is off, the monitor stays at its lowest light and this much "
"black is added on top. 25 % = a little darker, 100 % = fully black."
msgstr ""
"Tant que l’écran est éteint, le moniteur reste à sa lumière minimale et "
"autant de noir est ajouté par-dessus. 25 % = un peu plus sombre, 100 % = "
"tout noir."

#: src/lib/ui.js:1617
#, javascript-format
msgid "Keep lit for %s"
msgstr "Garder allumé %s"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1618
#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"On: after the mouse leaves, the screen stays lit for %s, then goes dark. "
"Off: it goes dark as soon as the mouse leaves."
msgstr ""
"Activé : quand la souris part, l’écran reste allumé encore %s, puis "
"s’assombrit. Désactivé : il s’assombrit dès que la souris part."

#: src/lib/ui.js:1702
#, javascript-format
msgid "Brightness %s"
msgstr "Luminosité %s"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1704
msgid "Turned off"
msgstr "Éteint"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1724
#, javascript-format
msgid "Sunset %s %s %d min"
msgstr "Coucher %s %s %d min"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1727
msgid "Fixed time"
msgstr "Heure fixe"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1730
#, javascript-format
msgid "Until %s"
msgstr "Jusqu’à %s"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1739
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Désactivée"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1837
msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "Température"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1840
msgid "Back to GNOME’s default"
msgstr "Revenir à la valeur de GNOME"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1934
msgid "Sunset to sunrise"
msgstr "Du coucher au lever du soleil"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1956
msgid "Turns on together with Night Light"
msgstr "S’active avec l’éclairage nocturne"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1958
msgid "Starts when Night Light starts"
msgstr "Démarre avec l’éclairage nocturne"
